Vazifa

Siz bildirishnomalar yuboruvchi tizim ishlab chiqishingiz kerak.
Tizim foydalanuvchilarga SMS, Telegram va Email orqali xabar
yuborishi mumkin.

Tizimda quyidagi interfeys mavjud:

NotificationService

public interface NotificationService {
    void send(String recipient, String message);
}

SMS xizmati ushbu interfeysga mos ishlaydi.
Ammo Telegram va Email xizmatlari boshqa metodlarga ega:

TelegramClient — sendTelegramMessage(String chatId, String text)

EmailClient — sendEmail(String emailAddress, String subject, String body)

Bu klasslarni o‘zgartirish mumkin emas.
Ularni NotificationService interfeysi bilan ishlatish uchun Adapter Pattern dan foydalaning.

Talablar

NotificationService interfeysini yarating.

SmsNotificationService klassini yarating.

TelegramClient va EmailClient klasslarini yarating.
Ularning metodlari yuqorida ko‘rsatilganidek bo‘lishi kerak.

TelegramAdapter va EmailAdapter klasslarini yarating.
Ular NotificationService interfeysini amalga oshirsin.

NotificationManager klassini yarating.
U NotificationService orqali xabar yuborsin.

Main klassida SMS, Telegram va Email orqali xabar yuborishni tekshiring.

Qo‘shimcha shart

NotificationManager ichida
Telegram yoki Email uchun alohida tekshiruvlar (if/else) bo‘lmasligi kerak.
U faqat NotificationService interfeysi bilan ishlashi lozim.

Kutilayotgan natija

Barcha xizmatlar bir xil interfeys orqali ishlaydi,
garchi ularning dastlabki metodlari bir-biridan farq qilsa ham.
